    "type": "cexolocstring",
    "value": {
      "0": "The pitted iron of the blade bites deep into the flesh, weeping a corrosive bile that burns even as it mends the spirit. It is a crude instrument of war, balanced for a heavy, biting strike that leaves the victim weakened and gasping."
